  "body_html": "<h1>injOn_sdiff</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma injOn_sdiff (s : Finset X) (f : X → Y) (h : s.card = (Finset.image f s).card + 1) : ∃ a b, a ∈ s ∧ b ∈ s ∧ f a = f b ∧ a ≠ b ∧ Set.InjOn f (s \\ ({a, b} : Finset X))</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n</ul>",
